  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fair Share Membership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FairPensions calls for responsible investment by UK pension funds. As owners of about a fifth of the UK stock market, pension funds have the power to challenge companies to improve their behaviour. FairPensions believes that pension funds should consider their members&apos; values - instead many pension funds invest in companies that undermine human rights and damage the environment.</narrative>
  </description>
